{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018EwbmhcKrWe9L7oqxuyvQK","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Taiwan news November 10 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_News\"},{\"title\":\"Front Page - Taipei Times\",\"url\":\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News - Voice of the People, Bridge to the World\",\"url\":\"https://www.taiwannews.com.tw/\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Journal\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Journal\"},{\"title\":\"TVBS News\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TVBS_News\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan Daily\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taiwan_Daily\"},{\"title\":\"TaiwanPlus\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TaiwanPlus\"},{\"title\":\"Taiwan News\",\"url\":\"https://www.newsnow.co.uk/h/World+News/Asia/Taiwan\"},{\"title\":\"Focus Taiwan - CNA English News\",\"url\":\"https://focustaiwan.tw/\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up a dated list for November 10, 2026, so these are the most recent items I could find, and their dates are uneven.\n\n- **Focus Taiwan (marked as today):** Headlines include Second batch of F-16V jets arrives in Taiwan, Lai highlights Taiwan's push for independent satellite launches, and Taiwan military stages live-fire drill in Kinmen.\n- **Taipei Times (dated Nov 6–9):** One item is an investigation launched by Nvidia into its founder and CEO Jensen Huang over his affair with an alleged Chinese spy, which analysts expect to have little impact on Taiwan's AI supply chain. Another reports that Taiwan today ordered the financial regulator to \"stabilize\" the stock market during a global sell-off, and shares in TSMC plummeted as much as 9.8 percent. A third reports that a legislator, May Chin, and three aides were indicted over suspected Chinese funding.\n- **Taiwan News (listed as 2 days old):** Headlines include a Magnitude 4.2 earthquake jolts central Taiwa